{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub055_rocket_F_01",
      "hash": "5498d5667fefd771",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嘘……！我是一名\\n正在执行任务的美女间谍……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub055_rocket_F_02",
      "hash": "5498d2667fefd258",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……像你这样的小孩子，\\n为什么会来这里？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub055_select_01",
      "hash": "4a4a607772b44436",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "为了打倒火箭队"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub055_select_02",
      "hash": "4a4a5f7772b44283",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "随便走走"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub055_rocket_F_03",
      "hash": "5498d3667fefd40b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……呵呵！说得好！\\n我欣赏你！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub055_rocket_F_04",
      "hash": "5498d8667fefdc8a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……呵呵！\\n你真是有趣的小孩子啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub055_rocket_F_05",
      "hash": "5498d9667fefde3d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "认识你很开心，\\n不如我送你个礼物吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub055_system_01",
      "hash": "6f29e6463da93961",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]从美女间谍那里\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]火箭队套装[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub055_system_02",
      "hash": "6f29e3463da93448",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]把[VAR COLOR(0006)]火箭队套装[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n放入了换装箱里！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub055_rocket_F_06",
      "hash": "5498d6667fefd924",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "穿上它，\\n瞬间就能变身成火箭队的调调！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub055_rocket_F_07",
      "hash": "5498d7667fefdad7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……不过，以你的身形穿上它，\\n别人一看就知道\\r\\n你其实是在cosplay了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub055_rocket_F_08",
      "hash": "5498cc667fefc826",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "如果你把我间谍的身份\\n说出去的话……\\r\\n我可饶不了你喔！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_055_max",
      "hash": "eed5f39da5c02f50"
    }
  ]
}
